WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.343 --> 00:00:01.997
- [Voiceover] Yeah,
every guitar has a story.

00:00:01.997 --> 00:00:05.080
(heavy guitar music)

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:11.760
(soft guitar music)

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.631
- My name is Rick Kelly.

00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:16.627
I custom-make guitars here
at Carmine Street Guitars.

00:00:16.627 --> 00:00:18.366
I make guitars from reclaimed lumber,

00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:20.603
old New York City building wood

00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:23.644
and from 200 year old trees.

00:00:23.644 --> 00:00:25.844
Most of the wood is being thrown away

00:00:25.844 --> 00:00:29.052
and so I just dumpster dive for it.

00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:31.539
The craft of it is one
of my favorite things.

00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:35.066
You know, building from the
materials that are historic

00:00:35.066 --> 00:00:38.347
and coming up with
instruments that make music

00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:42.486
and are kind of alive in a different way.

00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:44.425
It's a lot of, you know, steps involved.

00:00:44.425 --> 00:00:45.535
(lively guitar music)

00:00:45.535 --> 00:00:48.773
I bring the wood here and
then I have to de-nail it

00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:52.818
and then surface it and cut
it to shape on the band saw,

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:57.098
sand it smooth, and then I
use mostly shellac finishes,

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:59.265
which is a natural finish.

00:01:00.303 --> 00:01:03.149
A lot of people have come
through Carmine Street Guitars

00:01:03.149 --> 00:01:05.943
and bought my custom
guitars over the years.

00:01:05.943 --> 00:01:10.076
Bob Dylan, Lou Reed, Patti
Smith band, Roger Waters,

00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:13.159
Steely Dan band, so many other bands.

00:01:14.308 --> 00:01:15.892
(acoustic guitar music)

00:01:15.892 --> 00:01:18.772
To be able to give life
back into the instrument

00:01:18.772 --> 00:01:21.085
from the old timbers that built this city

00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:22.524
is a wonderful feeling.

00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:24.708
To be able to make it have a new life

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:28.524
and turn into something that makes music.

00:01:28.524 --> 00:01:29.774
It's wonderful.

